	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Kailh PG1316S (CPG1316S01D02-01) low-profile switch. Land pattern per Kailh datasheet; contact pads widened 0.825 mm inward to also cover the +/-1.5 mm placement used by vuoz/chalk. Plated holes in every pad so the switch is soldered from the back with an iron. Frame pads have no net. Courtyard = 16.25 x 16.05 mm stock keycap.")
